                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Fever, Sore Throat, and Body Aches\n*   **Pain Relievers and Fever Reducers:** Acetaminophen (Tylenol) or Nonsteroidal Anti-inflammatory Drugs (NSAIDs) like ibuprofen (Advil, Motrin) can help reduce fever, ease headaches, and soothe a sore throat"
