              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1810,
                "end_index": 1955,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Cough\n*   **Expectorants:** Medications containing **guaifenesin** (e.g., Mucinex) help thin and loosen mucus, making your coughs more productive"
