              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3122,
                "end_index": 3368,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "*   **Pediatric Warning:** Do not give OTC cough and cold medicines to infants or young children (typically those under 4 to 6 years old) without consulting a pediatrician first, as these medications can cause serious side effects in young bodies"
